// Page Intro Text :
"P3448305527" "We're sealing off this road until we get the situation in Galaxy City under control. I can't let you through."
// Answer Text :
"P3792634236" "What's happening in Galaxy City?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4009575071" "What hasn't happened? I've never seen anything like it in my life. Meteors raining from the sky - half the city is destroyed. And if that wasn't bad enough, some sort of alien host came out of those meteors. It's total chaos!"
// Answer Text :
"P4105357771" "You've got to let me in. I can help!"
// Answer Text :
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3482199556" "Look, I can't let you in. The city is in ruins. Besides, the Freedom Corps is in there. They'll set things right."
// DisplayName for N_Cop_Talk :
